@startuml getHttpReleaseNumberAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getHttpReleaseNumberAsync – Retrieve release-number
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "HTTP Client Interface" as hci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
         HTTP client UUID
end note

requestor -> hci: (httpClientUuid)
activate hci

hci -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> hci: HTTP client List
deactivate jd

note over hci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate LTP matching httpClientUuid  
  - Read attribute: release-number  
  - Return release-number if found  
  - Return undefined if not found
end note

hci --> requestor: release-number | undefined
deactivate hci

@enduml
